# If only in Russian: если бы
subtitle: "Tom and Masha imagine another life: learn е́сли бы, the Russian if for what isn't so."
tags: ["russian","если бы","russian conditional","if only","russian grammar"]
teaches: ["grammar/conditional"]
thumb: "band \"If only, in Russian\""
voices: {"a":"gemini:Achird | Tom, a warm, easy-going English speaker who knows Russian well; friendly with Masha, clear and unhurried; says Russian words the way a native Russian speaker would","b":"gemini:Leda | a friendly young Russian woman from Moscow, natural and lively, speaks English with a light Russian accent and says Russian words natively; never exaggerated"}
next: {"title":"Used to it in Russian: я привык к…","href":"https://www.drawcast.app/#gh=hmelberg/drawcast-library/russian-from-zero/129-russian-verb-cases.cast"}

