    ask "What did she think about, back in Moscow?" listen [{"voice":"b","who":"Маша","text":"Верну́вшись в Москву́, я мно́го ду́мала о Петербу́рге.","gloss":"Back in Moscow, I thought a lot about Petersburg."},{"voice":"a","who":"Tom","text":"Жаль, что тебя́ здесь нет.","gloss":"Pity you're not here."},{"voice":"b","who":"Маша","text":"Е́сли бы у меня́ была́ рабо́та в Петербу́рге, я бы перее́хала.","gloss":"If I had a job in Petersburg, I'd move."}] options ["Petersburg","her exams","the sea"] correct 1 transcript false reveal.text "ду́мала о Петербу́рге" reveal.at.x 500 reveal.at.y 300 reveal.style label reveal.size 56 reveal.color #3d3833 test t1
