audio:
  lang: en
  lines:
    '|a||If only in Russian: если бы':
      mp3: 
      ms: 3880
      voice: gemini:Achird | Tom, a warm, easy-going English speaker who knows Russian well; friendly with Masha, clear and unhurried; says Russian words the way a native Russian speaker would
    '|a||Tom and Masha imagine another life: learn е́сли бы, the Russian if for what isn''t so.':
      mp3: 
      ms: 6840
      voice: 'gemini:Achird | Tom, a warm, easy-going English speaker who knows Russian well; friendly with Masha, clear and unhurried; says Russian words the way a native Russian speaker would #ctx:ooctxi'
    '|a||How do you say if, about something that isn''t real, in Russian? Март. Ма́ша звони́т из Москвы́.':
      mp3: 
      ms: 8960
      voice: gemini:Achird | Tom, a warm, easy-going English speaker who knows Russian well; friendly with Masha, clear and unhurried; says Russian words the way a native Russian speaker would
    '|a||Послу́шайте.':
      mp3: 
      ms: 1240
      voice: 'gemini:Achird | Tom, a warm, easy-going English speaker who knows Russian well; friendly with Masha, clear and unhurried; says Russian words the way a native Russian speaker would #ctx:fne57'
    '|b||Е́сли бы ты не перее́хал, мы бы не гуля́ли бе́лой но́чью.':
      mp3: 
      ms: 4240
      voice: 'gemini:Leda | a friendly young Russian woman from Moscow, natural and lively, speaks English with a light Russian accent and says Russian words natively; never exaggerated #ctx:fpqb5c'
    '|a||Да. А е́сли бы ты жила́ здесь, мы бы гуля́ли ка́ждый день!':
      mp3: 
      ms: 4760
      voice: gemini:Achird | Tom, a warm, easy-going English speaker who knows Russian well; friendly with Masha, clear and unhurried; says Russian words the way a native Russian speaker would
    '|b||Посмо́трим!':
      mp3: 
      ms: 1280
      voice: gemini:Leda | a friendly young Russian woman from Moscow, natural and lively, speaks English with a light Russian accent and says Russian words natively; never exaggerated
    '|a||If Masha lived in Petersburg, what would they do every day?':
      mp3: 
      ms: 4080
      voice: gemini:Achird | Tom, a warm, easy-going English speaker who knows Russian well; friendly with Masha, clear and unhurried; says Russian words the way a native Russian speaker would
    '|a||Мы бы гуля́ли ка́ждый день: we''d walk every day.':
      mp3: 
      ms: 4080
      voice: gemini:Achird | Tom, a warm, easy-going English speaker who knows Russian well; friendly with Masha, clear and unhurried; says Russian words the way a native Russian speaker would
    '|a||So does Masha live in Petersburg now?':
      mp3: 
      ms: 3400
      voice: gemini:Achird | Tom, a warm, easy-going English speaker who knows Russian well; friendly with Masha, clear and unhurried; says Russian words the way a native Russian speaker would
    '|a||Пра́вильно! Е́сли бы ты жила́ здесь: if you lived here. But she doesn''t.':
      mp3: 
      ms: 6640
      voice: gemini:Achird | Tom, a warm, easy-going English speaker who knows Russian well; friendly with Masha, clear and unhurried; says Russian words the way a native Russian speaker would
    '|b||Посмотри́те. Е́сли бы ты не перее́хал,':
      mp3: 
      ms: 3520
      voice: gemini:Leda | a friendly young Russian woman from Moscow, natural and lively, speaks English with a light Russian accent and says Russian words natively; never exaggerated
    '|b||мы бы не гуля́ли бе́лой но́чью.':
      mp3: 
      ms: 2760
      voice: 'gemini:Leda | a friendly young Russian woman from Moscow, natural and lively, speaks English with a light Russian accent and says Russian words natively; never exaggerated #ctx:606ckv'
    '|a||Е́сли бы ты жила́ здесь,':
      mp3: 
      ms: 2480
      voice: 'gemini:Achird | Tom, a warm, easy-going English speaker who knows Russian well; friendly with Masha, clear and unhurried; says Russian words the way a native Russian speaker would #ctx:1nnqz22'
    '|a||мы бы гуля́ли ка́ждый день!':
      mp3: 
      ms: 2480
      voice: 'gemini:Achird | Tom, a warm, easy-going English speaker who knows Russian well; friendly with Masha, clear and unhurried; says Russian words the way a native Russian speaker would #ctx:g26hfe'
    '|a||Е́сли бы: if, but it isn''t so.':
      mp3: 
      ms: 3880
      voice: 'gemini:Achird | Tom, a warm, easy-going English speaker who knows Russian well; friendly with Masha, clear and unhurried; says Russian words the way a native Russian speaker would #ctx:mdfwi9'
    '|a||I did move, and Ма́ша живёт в Москве́. Both lines picture another world.':
      mp3: 
      ms: 6320
      voice: 'gemini:Achird | Tom, a warm, easy-going English speaker who knows Russian well; friendly with Masha, clear and unhurried; says Russian words the way a native Russian speaker would #ctx:11jmz6x'
    '|a||Бы comes twice: after е́сли, and in the other half. Мы бы гуля́ли.':
      mp3: 
      ms: 5640
      voice: 'gemini:Achird | Tom, a warm, easy-going English speaker who knows Russian well; friendly with Masha, clear and unhurried; says Russian words the way a native Russian speaker would #ctx:1am7o3g'
    '|a||And the verb is past: жила́, гуля́ли. Even for now, even for every day.':
      mp3: 
      ms: 7800
      voice: 'gemini:Achird | Tom, a warm, easy-going English speaker who knows Russian well; friendly with Masha, clear and unhurried; says Russian words the way a native Russian speaker would #ctx:h6nyki'
    '|a||Lesson 68 had the real if. Now, side by side.':
      mp3: 
      ms: 4200
      voice: 'gemini:Achird | Tom, a warm, easy-going English speaker who knows Russian well; friendly with Masha, clear and unhurried; says Russian words the way a native Russian speaker would #ctx:1siujo'
    '|a||Е́сли бу́дет вре́мя: maybe I''ll have time. Е́сли бы бы́ло вре́мя: I don''t.':
      mp3: 
      ms: 6960
      voice: 'gemini:Achird | Tom, a warm, easy-going English speaker who knows Russian well; friendly with Masha, clear and unhurried; says Russian words the way a native Russian speaker would #ctx:qxta9o'
    '|a||Я позвоню́. Я бы позвони́л.':
      mp3: 
      ms: 3080
      voice: 'gemini:Achird | Tom, a warm, easy-going English speaker who knows Russian well; friendly with Masha, clear and unhurried; says Russian words the way a native Russian speaker would #ctx:1shkjfc'
    '|a||Real: usually the future. Not real: the past, with бы.':
      mp3: 
      ms: 5560
      voice: 'gemini:Achird | Tom, a warm, easy-going English speaker who knows Russian well; friendly with Masha, clear and unhurried; says Russian words the way a native Russian speaker would #ctx:8c79yt'
    '|b||Never бу́ду with бы.':
      mp3: 
      ms: 2360
      voice: 'gemini:Leda | a friendly young Russian woman from Moscow, natural and lively, speaks English with a light Russian accent and says Russian words natively; never exaggerated #ctx:1ht4i0p'
    '|a||Е́сли бы я не реши́л перее́хать,':
      mp3: 
      ms: 2720
      voice: 'gemini:Achird | Tom, a warm, easy-going English speaker who knows Russian well; friendly with Masha, clear and unhurried; says Russian words the way a native Russian speaker would #ctx:348l5'
    '|a||я бы не встре́тил Ни́ну Петро́вну.':
      mp3: 
      ms: 2960
      voice: 'gemini:Achird | Tom, a warm, easy-going English speaker who knows Russian well; friendly with Masha, clear and unhurried; says Russian words the way a native Russian speaker would #ctx:1eevub1'
    '|a||Встре́тить: to meet someone. Встре́тил кого́? Ни́ну Петро́вну.':
      mp3: 
      ms: 5920
      voice: 'gemini:Achird | Tom, a warm, easy-going English speaker who knows Russian well; friendly with Masha, clear and unhurried; says Russian words the way a native Russian speaker would #ctx:1dak7pn'
    '|a||With ся: to meet up. Встре́титься с кем? С Ма́шей.':
      mp3: 
      ms: 5200
      voice: 'gemini:Achird | Tom, a warm, easy-going English speaker who knows Russian well; friendly with Masha, clear and unhurried; says Russian words the way a native Russian speaker would #ctx:kohzng'
    '|b||Когда́ мы встре́тимся?':
      mp3: 
      ms: 1600
      voice: 'gemini:Leda | a friendly young Russian woman from Moscow, natural and lively, speaks English with a light Russian accent and says Russian words natively; never exaggerated #ctx:194n0v1'
    '|a||Тогда́: then, in that case or back then. Тогда́ я жил в Ло́ндоне.':
      mp3: 
      ms: 7200
      voice: 'gemini:Achird | Tom, a warm, easy-going English speaker who knows Russian well; friendly with Masha, clear and unhurried; says Russian words the way a native Russian speaker would #ctx:1f9t8il'
    '|a||Мечта́: a dream; мечта́ть о чём: to dream of it. Я мечта́ю о мо́ре.':
      mp3: 
      ms: 8480
      voice: 'gemini:Achird | Tom, a warm, easy-going English speaker who knows Russian well; friendly with Masha, clear and unhurried; says Russian words the way a native Russian speaker would #ctx:1aoy2wq'
    '|a||Жаль: it''s a pity. Жаль, что тебя́ здесь нет.':
      mp3: 
      ms: 4480
      voice: 'gemini:Achird | Tom, a warm, easy-going English speaker who knows Russian well; friendly with Masha, clear and unhurried; says Russian words the way a native Russian speaker would #ctx:hkehw9'
    '|a||Да́льше. The call goes on. Tap Practise after the dialogue, and be me.':
