      ms: 5840
      voice: 'gemini:Achird | Tom, a warm, easy-going English speaker who knows Russian well; friendly with Masha, clear and unhurried; says Russian words the way a native Russian speaker would #ctx:hcnf9d'
    '|a||Запо́лните про́пуски. Вы́берите.':
      mp3: 
      ms: 3240
      voice: 'gemini:Achird | Tom, a warm, easy-going English speaker who knows Russian well; friendly with Masha, clear and unhurried; says Russian words the way a native Russian speaker would #ctx:zqms7l'
    '|a||Запо́лните про́пуски.':
      mp3: 
      ms: 1800
      voice: 'gemini:Achird | Tom, a warm, easy-going English speaker who knows Russian well; friendly with Masha, clear and unhurried; says Russian words the way a native Russian speaker would #ctx:oqolpv'
    '|a||Е́сли бы я знал, я бы позвони́л. Past, and бы twice.':
