      voice: 'gemini:Achird | Tom, a warm, easy-going English speaker who knows Russian well; friendly with Masha, clear and unhurried; says Russian words the way a native Russian speaker would #ctx:13f42uj'
    '|b||Напиши́те, to Masha: If you lived here, we''d walk every day.':
